This product reimplements the training semantics of HuggingFace `tokenizers`
(https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers, Apache License 2.0) in order to
produce byte-identical merge lists. No source code was copied, but the
following are derived from that project and are used under Apache-2.0:

- Test vectors in `gigabpe/src/trainer.rs` and `gigabpe/src/word.rs`,
  ported from `tokenizers/src/models/bpe/trainer.rs` and
  `tokenizers/src/models/bpe/word.rs` (tests `test_train`,
  `bpe_test_max_token_length_direct_assert`, `test_merge`,
  `test_merge_max_length`).
- The behavioral specification documented in PARITY.md, determined by reading
  that project's source at tag v0.22.2.

Apache-2.0 was chosen for compatibility with the above.
